{
  "hero_headline": "AI 落地浪潮与地缘经济震荡：全球技术与金融的关键转折点 / AI Implementation Wave and Geopolitical Economic Shocks",
  "daily_overview": "全球视野下的今日焦点：科技领域正从「模型竞赛」转向「应用提效」，DeepSeek V4.1 及各种智能体框架的发布，标志着 AI 正在以更高性价比渗入编程与文档处理流程。财经方面，受中东冲突与法国局势影响，欧元波动与能源市场焦虑并存，全球资本正重新评估地缘政治风险对供应链的威胁。时政层面，法国骚乱、美国外交转向以及欧洲能源危机正共同构筑一个不确定性增强的政治底色，全球市场正处于高技术进步与高地缘扰动的叠加期。\n\nThe global focus today: the tech sector is shifting from 'model racing' to 'efficiency gains,' as the release of DeepSeek V4.1 and various agent frameworks signal AI's integration into coding and document processing at scale. Financially, euro volatility and energy market anxiety persist amid conflicts in the Middle East and domestic unrest in France. Politically, the situation in France, shifting US diplomatic stance, and the European energy crisis form a backdrop of heightened uncertainty, leaving global markets at the intersection of rapid technological advancement and geopolitical turbulence.",
